WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.004 --> 00:00:04.401
Make a box set

2
00:00:04.908 --> 00:00:12.123
A box set bundles several of your books into one edition, ready to export and sell.

3
00:00:12.126 --> 00:00:26.373
Tick the books to include, in the order you want them.

4
00:00:26.376 --> 00:00:34.203
Create it, and each book becomes a part with its chapters inside. Format and export it like any other book.
